THIRD-PARTY LICENSES
====================

The PdfCraft embed build is a WebAssembly module compiled from PdfCraft's own source and from the
open-source Rust crates listed below. Each crate is used under the licence named in its section,
and the notice that licence requires is reproduced in full. PdfCraft's own licences are in
LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and NOTICE in this bundle; the licence texts of the fonts, icons,
CMaps and colour profiles compiled into the module are in licenses/. The crates named pdfcraft-*
are PdfCraft's own, under those same licences.

This file was generated by cargo-about from Cargo.lock, for the crates compiled into the module
for wasm32-unknown-unknown (no build scripts, no tests). A crate offered under several licences
("MIT OR Apache-2.0") is listed under the first of them that the project accepts. Where a crate's
package carries no licence file, or one the generator cannot read as a single licence, the
section shows the standard text of that licence and the crate's list entry names its authors, who
hold the copyright.

